From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GloriousEggroll <gloriouseggroll@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 10:00:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] ntdll: Keep builtin amd_ags_x64 ahead of version heuristic

The version-resource heuristic treats game-local AMD AGS libraries as native
first because their CompanyName is not Microsoft. This overrides Wine's
intentional builtin-first AGS policy from Wine commit
e87e9626a64893481fd45b875360c41717452f0b and can expose unsupported native
AGS device behavior.

Do not apply the heuristic to amd_ags_x64. Explicit environment and registry
load-order overrides are checked earlier, so PROTON_NATIVE_AGS and manual
overrides continue to work.

Forza Horizon 6 otherwise loads its bundled AGS library and crashes while
probing a secondary D3D12 device during startup.

Rebased onto the upstream version_heuristics() load order API in
wine-mirror 11.20 (get_load_order takes is_system_dir/pe_mapping instead of
the Proton version_res/version_len parameters). Skipping the heuristic falls
through to the hardcoded LO_DEFAULT builtin-first default.
---
 dlls/ntdll/unix/loadorder.c | 13 ++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/dlls/ntdll/unix/loadorder.c b/dlls/ntdll/unix/loadorder.c
--- a/dlls/ntdll/unix/loadorder.c
+++ b/dlls/ntdll/unix/loadorder.c
@@ -497,6 +497,7 @@ enum loadorder get_load_order( const UNICODE_STRING *nt_name, BOOL is_system_dir
                                const struct pe_mapping_info *pe_mapping )
 {
     static const WCHAR prefixW[] = {'\\','?','?','\\'};
+    static const WCHAR amd_ags_x64W[] = {'a','m','d','_','a','g','s','_','x','6','4',0};
     enum loadorder ret = LO_INVALID;
     const WCHAR *path = nt_name->Buffer;
     unsigned int len = nt_name->Length / sizeof(WCHAR);
@@ -536,6 +537,16 @@ enum loadorder get_load_order( const UNICODE_STRING *nt_name, BOOL is_system_dir
             TRACE( "got main exe default %s for %s\n", debugstr_loadorder(ret), debugstr_us(nt_name) );
             goto done;
         }
+        /* A game-local amd_ags_x64 has a non-Microsoft CompanyName, so the
+         * version heuristic below would load it native-first. Keep the
+         * hardcoded builtin-first default for it instead; explicit load-order
+         * overrides were already checked above. */
+        if (!wcsicmp( basename, amd_ags_x64W ))
+        {
+            ret = LO_DEFAULT;
+            TRACE( "got hardcoded %s for AGS library %s\n", debugstr_loadorder(ret), debugstr_us(nt_name) );
+            goto done;
+        }
         ret = version_heuristics( nt_name, pe_mapping );
         if (ret != LO_INVALID) goto done;
     }
--
2.51.0
